{
    "title": "Ad-silence - OpenSource",
    "description": "Silence ads in Accuradio android app, Spotify, Spotify lite android app, Soundcloud android app,  Pandora android App & TIDAL android app.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Mutes ads in Accuradio, Spotify & TIDAL automatically, when they are being played.\r\n- Lightweight (~ 150KB)\r\n- Minimal UI\r\n- Configure which apps to remove ads in\r\n- No bloat/external dependencies\r\n- Open source\r\n- No inapp purchases or ads\r\n- Easily extensible to other apps\r\n- If you want this to work on a different streaming service, open an issue on the github repository.\r\n\r\ncheck https://github.com/aghontpi/ad-silence#how-this-works, for how this works.\r\n\r\nCheck https://github.com/aghontpi/ad-silence for more",
    "descriptionHTML": "Silence ads in Accuradio android app, Spotify, Spotify lite android app, Soundcloud android app,  Pandora android App &amp; TIDAL android app.<br><br>Features:<br>- Mutes ads in Accuradio, Spotify &amp; TIDAL automatically, when they are being played.<br>- Lightweight (~ 150KB)<br>- Minimal UI<br>- Configure which apps to remove ads in<br>- No bloat/external dependencies<br>- Open source<br>- No inapp purchases or ads<br>- Easily extensible to other apps<br>- If you want this to work on a different streaming service, open an issue on the github repository.<br><br>check https://github.com/aghontpi/ad-silence#how-this-works, for how this works.<br><br>Check https://github.com/aghontpi/ad-silence for more",
